  <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://caritas.dk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/The-Road-to-Recovery-Survivors-of-Gender-based-Violence-in-Lebanon.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Case Study 2023: The Road to Recovery: Survivors of Gender-based Violence in Lebanon</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Lebanons&#x2019;s holistic shelter model empowers highly vulnerable gender-based violence (GBV)survivors to independently re-enter society. In 2023, the protection, legal, social and healthneeds of 14 refugee women and their 24 children were met, preventing negative copingmechanisms, exploitation and abuse. Through holistic programming, residents received careand developed skills empowering them to regain dignity of life and self-reliance, seek justice,and access employment opportunities. 6 families left the shelter, receiving post-shelter care.</narrative>
   </description>
